### Create exchange — run once before publishing
PUT https://{{host}}/api/exchanges/{{vhost}}/{{exchange}}
Authorization: Basic {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "direct",
  "durable": true
}

### Event reminder — works while app is closed
POST https://{{host}}/api/exchanges/{{vhost}}/{{exchange}}/publish
Authorization: Basic {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": {},
  "routing_key": "user-{{userId}}",
  "payload": "event-reminder|Event Reminder|Stage Naigairyu starts in 30 minutes",
  "payload_encoding": "string"
}

### Training reminder — works while app is closed
POST https://{{host}}/api/exchanges/{{vhost}}/{{exchange}}/publish
Authorization: Basic {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": {},
  "routing_key": "user-{{userId}}",
  "payload": "training-reminder|Training Reminder|Your training starts in 30 minutes",
  "payload_encoding": "string"
}

