### Change notification — in-app only
POST https://{{host}}/api/exchanges/{{vhost}}/{{exchange}}/publish
Authorization: Basic {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": {},
  "routing_key": "user-{{userId}}",
  "payload": "change|Technique Updated|Gekruist vastnemen 1 hand has been updated",
  "payload_encoding": "string"
}

